msgid "AirPixel ENTIRE R3 for Camera Control and EXIF Geotagging"
msgstr "AirPixel ENTIRE R3 相机控制与 EXIF 地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:11
#: 120dbdfc74b0423996033633748a86da 1c56c178934e4799bb245dbedac3bef5
#: 1d05af5237724c11adef6e3520688d6f 21cff1d3ed194dc5af16f2dc208041f5
#: 623528da810c400b95fb71fd24080a58
msgid ""
"The `ENTIRE R3 <https://airpixel.cz/entire-r3>`_ is a standalone device for "
"GeoTagging of images in-camera SD card.  GPS data data is read from the "
"autopilot's serial port (aka MAVLink bus) and is then saved directly into "
"the photos using EXIF. The ENTIRE can also trigger the camera shutter via "
"MAVLink commands, control video recording and zoom and many other commands."
msgstr ""
"`ENTIRE R3 <https://airpixel.cz/entire-r3>`_ 是一款用于在相机 SD "
"卡中对图像进行地理标记的独立设备。GPS 数据从飞控的串口（即 MAVLink 总线）读取，然后直接通过 EXIF 保存到照片中。ENTIRE "
"还可以通过 MAVLink 命令触发相机快门、控制视频录制和变焦以及许多其他命令。"

